asters as the  character liz one other project that may  be familiar to yellowstone viewers is  the iron orchard based on the novel by  tom pendleton the iron orchard is a film  set amongst the oil fields in a world  war ii era texas hassi harrison plays  the lovely mazie wales the sweet love  interest of the movie's protagonist jim  mcneely mcneely sets out to the oil  fields in the hopes of hitting it big  but he soon learns that working in the  fields of texas is tough work and  fortunes don't happen overnight true to  form harrison's character fits the  glamorous vibrant lipstick style of the  times with a texas-sized personality  ultimately she's the driving force that  motivates mcnealy to make a name for  himself the movie's imdb rating sits at  a mid-level 5.8 out of 10 which means  that it was a bit of a mixed bag for  viewers nevertheless it's only more  proof that if there's one role harrison  has perfected it's that of a country gal  yellowstone isn't harrison's only  experience working as part of the main  cast of a television show although  tacoma fd is a bit more comedic than the  western themed drama yellowstone viewers  might be used to hassie harrison is seen  as lucy a fun-loving upbeat young  addition to the fire department lucy is  the daughter of the fire department  chief terry who isn't sure about her  joining the crew but she soon proves him  wrong so if you're all caught up on  yellowstone and looking to see more of  harrison but maybe less of laramie check  out any of these performances  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite actors are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

